Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托宾  声音没停  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin, it's not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射信号弹  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light it up. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-米琼恩  -我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michonne. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  有一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit! It was half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  不止一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, it was more than half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶在它们前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta stay ahead of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们走  我们跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They walk, we run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克  -我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick! - I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半行尸改变了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of them broke off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们朝亚历山大去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going toward Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝你们去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们跑在前面  有喇叭声  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran ahead. There's a horn or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音很大  从东边传来的  一直不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loud, coming from the east. It's not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要踩油门折回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna gas it up, turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来处理  你继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have it. You keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:00:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须让尸群继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta keep the herd moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果家里出事  就不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if it's going down, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果剩余的尸群也掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of that herd turns around,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家里的情况只会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bad back there gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的脚踝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  搭着我  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Grab on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.47,0:01:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音是从家那边传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肯定是  -是他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It has to be. - He did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带我们来这里送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought us all out here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他杀了卡特  -卡特本来就必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He killed Carter. - Carter was dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在家里有麻烦了  我们也死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're in trouble back there and we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们死定了  -冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're good as dead. - Hey, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们死定了  都是因为他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are done. And it's 'cause of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了  这是新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up. Here's the new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回去开房车  从雷丁路绕过森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go back, get the RV, circle around the woods on Redding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会赶在它们前面抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get in front of them before they get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以再次引走它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can lead them away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房车离这里有一英里  我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}RV's a mile back. I can go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去吧  你们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle it. Just get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也许需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might need you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管遇到什么  格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something's in front of you, you kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用躲藏和等待  一直往家走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hiding, no waiting. You keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起去  你一个人做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with you. You can't do this on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-格伦  我能做到  -你得帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn, I can do this. - You need to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.89,0:02:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得把这些人带回去  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got to get these people back. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是  他们未必能全活着回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, they aren't all gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克  -你们努力救他们  尽力了就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick. - You try to save them, you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但假如他们跟不上  你们就接着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they can't keep up, you keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须得这样  你们要确保自己回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to. You make sure you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喇叭声停了  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horn stopped. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一路平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在它们前面了  十分钟的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ahead of it. 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是二十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 minutes, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们保持这个速度  就能安全回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all keep up the pace, we all get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如有人跟不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就死定了  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不知道家里什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what's waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  墙不是白建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay. We have walls for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个声音  也许有人冲进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound. Maybe someone plowed right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们回去发现一切都被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're walking back to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  我老婆还在那里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, my wife's back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.23,0:05:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  别担心出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't worry about what's gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想现在怎么办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure out how to make this go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们前进的方向和其他东西一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving in the same direction everything else is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会碰上一些东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna catch up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会碰上很多东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna catch up with a lot of things
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们会干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有必要别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot unless you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  那是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:26.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯特奇斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sturgess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得继续前进  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep moving, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走了有五英里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we gone five miles out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take some yardage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a reason for asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在下一个十字路口  我们就掉头回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next intersection we're gonna spin around and go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划是再走十五英里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is to go 15 more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我要改变计划  五英里就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm gonna change that. Five's gonna have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是二十英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magic number's 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是我们的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是为了确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's making sure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在不死的余生中去攻击虚弱的浣熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're off munching on infirm raccoons the rest of their undead lives
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是来吃我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想走的话  我们没法拦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go, we can't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没有你的话  它们也许会干掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But without you, they could stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(亚历山大  可持续生活的开始)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的  我对你们有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I got faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -别这样  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl! - Don't do it, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能看下吗  -请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I take a look? - Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你预料的差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about what you'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没料到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, didn't expect this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你结婚多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变前她并不是我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't my wife from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早些时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我独自一人  一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was alone, lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举目无亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失自我  我没有疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}myself, I-- I wasn't crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:53.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是内心放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gave up on being someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成行尸走肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}an actual person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:09:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回社区的路上  我们发现了贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found Betsy on the way back to the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我自暴自弃的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still saw me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她仍看到了真正的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I thought I was dead and gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我的第一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was my first friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后她变成了我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she was more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也让我变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至比灾变前更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better than how I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能回去  我希望能跟她道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I could make it back, I'd want to say good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能在末世与她相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}finding her in all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意味着一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得停下来给他包扎一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stop and bandage him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  继续走吧  我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we keep moving. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不止血  你就不会"很好"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be if we don't stop your bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.49,0:10:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能在露天停留太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stop out in the open too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:10:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先检查一下这些车是否能开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check if these cars work first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看能否开车回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if they can get us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他们待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我是想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I need to get home,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会抛下他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not leaving them behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给斯科特包扎一下  然后就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We patch Scott up, we get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克虽然那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick knows what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们领先于尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ahead of the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可能领先了半小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe half an hour now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以停留  我们能回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stop. We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一半路就到家了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is halfway home, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.07,0:12:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是在这发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在拖拉机店那里说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it at the dealership.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和艾登不知道我们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Aiden didn't know what we were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你死去的那个同伴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people on your crew who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们并不害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们却怕极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得步行回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stay on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯来过这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas was here last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可以给我们带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can show us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车都不能开\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扶你  我扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯特奇斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sturgess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.49,0:13:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他抛下了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left us behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸群在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herd's that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.81,0:15:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给斯科特和安妮包扎一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}patch Scott and Annie up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小巷里和街上的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those walkers in the alley and down the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堵住了出城的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're blocking the way out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能正面对抗  尤其是以现在的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take 'em on, not in the shape that we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.87,0:15:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有必要的话我们得把它们引走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to lead them away if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,近来这招可真有效呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's been working well lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  暂时还没呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能有办法引走即将到来的尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can find a way to distract the herd coming in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们就不会去社区了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they won't make it back to the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧掉一栋楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn one of the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越多越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会被吸引  止步于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get drawn to it and they'll stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这需要好一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去办  你陪着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it. You stay with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的主意  我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my plan. It's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:15:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有妻子  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a wife, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得护送大家回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to get everybody back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我很久未归  你就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I take too long, you just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会抛下你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不能这样  -我们社区见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is not the way this works. - I will meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get stuck out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.15,0:16:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会想办法告诉你们我还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find some way to show you guys I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有自己的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有间饲料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a feed store.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很老  里面有很多干的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's old. A lot of dry stuff inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该很易燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should go up easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以画地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can-- I can draw a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你领路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先去做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gotta do one thing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我是格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, it's Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在绿标记偏东五度的小镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a town five degrees east of the green marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在二十分钟内\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get around on Redding
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从雷丁路绕过去  你就能赶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the next 20 minutes, you should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们领先尸群的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's how far we're ahead of the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备放火引走它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try to set a fire and distract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是没看到烟  那它们还是会朝你那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't see smoke, they're still coming your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运  笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能让你撑回医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll keep you going until we get you back to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮  我会帮你找一根拐杖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie, I'm gonna figure out a crutch for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.53,0:18:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在拖你们后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm slowing you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还会遇到更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna hit more roamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.09,0:18:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们照顾我太愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stupid for you guys to wait on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll all go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  醒醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在不想抛下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在外面不要犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们又陷入困境  你们就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get into trouble again, you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-头也不要回  -不  要走就一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you don't look back. - No, if we go, we go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会一如既往地互相照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got each other's backs just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会抛弃别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we don't leave people behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我们的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人要抛弃谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is leaving anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来帮你找点支撑物  安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find something for you, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我有什么意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a problem with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在关心我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just looking out for my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我不关心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think that I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到瑞克说的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I heard what Rick said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪一段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which part?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们未必能全活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How they wouldn't all make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他们"说的是我们  不是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They meaning us and not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们跟不上  你们就该丢下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you should leave us behind if we can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦为了你和其他人在外面冒着生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn is out there risking his life for you and for everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm still here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白你到底在胡说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况会越来越糟  我们走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are gonna get worse and then we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克之所以说那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick said what he said
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为有时你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}because sometimes you don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:20:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是这样行事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你们从来没有陷入过绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you've never had to do it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们从没真正地经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been through it, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.03,0:21:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-米琼恩...  -不像瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michonne-- - Not like Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克和我都曾在外生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick was out there. I was out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们懂  你们不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你不吸取经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.61,0:21:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会死  我们也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will die, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从一开始就一直在出外勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been doing runs from the start, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我知道外面的情况  -你杀过人没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what it's like. - Have you ever had to kill people
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们已经杀了你的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they had already killed your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就会来杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and were coming for you next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有做过一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever done things
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事后让你自己都惧怕自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that made you feel afraid of yourself afterward?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是否曾全身都是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever been covered in so much blood
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.85,0:21:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你却不知道那到底是你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you didn't know if it was yours
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是行尸的  或是你朋友们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or walkers' or your friends'?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个该我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他之前是我小队里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was on my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:16.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.35,0:22:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他才十九岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们丢下了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We left him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是从前的你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.07,0:22:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是从前的你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是家那边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that home?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶快走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.02,0:23:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.43,0:23:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.35,0:23:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶快走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是之前街上和小巷里的那些行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones from down the street and in the alley,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们被枪声吸引走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're getting drawn by the gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.87,0:23:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等它们走光  我们就去饲料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as they clear, we head for the feed store.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前  我们先别动  保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then we sit tight, keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.49,0:25:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(贝琪  亲爱的  如果你在看这张纸条  那说明我没能活着回去)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.39,0:25:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(你会回家的)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.01,0:26:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们知道我们在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know we're in here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没办法等它们走光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't wait them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.91,0:26:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸群很快就会过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The herd, it's gonna be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.08,0:26:39.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.71,0:26:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.07,0:27:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.71,0:27:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饲料库在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the feed store?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快走  在小镇另一头  能试试  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! The other end of town. We can try-- - We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.67,0:27:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦说我们必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn said we got to go. We go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.43,0:27:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.56,0:27:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面  点着了就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just up ahead. We light it up and we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定还有别的楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.15,0:28:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.49,0:28:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.64,0:28:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-尼古拉斯  -这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nicholas! - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.10,0:28:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在这边  -快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This-- this way. - Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.45,0:28:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先过去  我们再帮斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go over first, and then we'll help Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.44,0:28:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  它们来了  快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're coming. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.97,0:28:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都翻过去  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing this. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.76,0:29:13.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.47,0:29:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.82,0:29:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.70,0:29:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.64,0:31:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走了  我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep going. We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.59,0:31:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来  上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here! Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.78,0:32:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.71,0:32:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯  看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas! Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.09,0:32:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我  看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at me! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.26,0:32:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.28,0:32:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.72,0:32:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.13,0:34:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.23,0:34:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.29,0:34:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不代表他们出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean they didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.96,0:35:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸群还在进发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The herd's still coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.70,0:35:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是小溪应该能减缓它们的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this creek should slow them down some.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.34,0:36:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.60,0:36:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该就位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in place by my best guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.04,0:36:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们回去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys make it back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.14,0:36:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托宾  你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.39,0:36:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.75,0:36:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.95,0:36:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.02,0:36:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把它们引回你那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get them going your way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.48,0:36:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout that, Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.54,0:36:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要来我们这边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.24,0:36:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家那边有枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gunfire coming from back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.11,0:36:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能忍着  期望他们自己能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta sit with it and hope they can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他们可以  他们必须可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they can. They have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要为他们继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep going forward for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.85,0:37:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能因为害怕而回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't turn back 'cause we're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.05,0:37:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.34,0:37:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划没完成之前回去  那是为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going back now before it's done, that'd be for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.12,0:37:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸群一定马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The herd has to be almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.46,0:38:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.07,0:38:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.25,0:38:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.96,0:41:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. No.
